{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","贝利尔"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名灵活的刺客，能够躲进影子规避伤害，并对孤立目标造成伤害。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","快乐的时光要开始啰~"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Hehehehehe~ Happy times are here!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","笑得更、更、更开心点儿！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Smile with ever more joy!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","猜——猜我在哪儿？"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Guess where I am!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","哇哦，退场时间……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Ugh... The curtain... falls..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","为大家带来快乐是我的荣幸~"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","I'm honored to bring joy to everyone!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","笑吧，闹吧，让世界——混乱吧！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","驚喜向您致意。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","为这个昏乱的世界笑一笑吧？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","啊，谁？是我自己啊。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇哦，你听到了吗——混沌的呼唤！哈哈哈哈哈！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","惊喜！刺激！那些好玩的东西都去哪里了？嗯？"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","这可不是小丑的表演道具……那就摔碎吧！啊哈哈哈！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","热闹点！再热闹点！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","要不要来个大拥抱？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","猜猜馅饼里头是什么？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","啧，雪啊，没意思"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","热闹点！再热闹点！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我给你们准备了惊喜！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","把这里变得更热闹吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","恶作剧的好时候！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","贝利尔从不独断，他总会给人一些选项——“坏的”和“更坏的”。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","只要贝利尔愿意，他完全可以悄无声息，销声匿迹；但他坚持要热热闹闹地出场，为了“让事情更有意思一些”。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","据说，在深夜的小巷里独自行走，听到远处有逐渐接近的铃铛声时，千万不要回头——你会看到贝利尔的嬉笑。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","耀光曾经有个很流行的恐怖传说：你的影子会站起来，模仿你，代替你。——贝利尔表示那并不是谣言。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","过去有个村庄爆发了饥荒，而贝利尔给他们提供了两大块面包，为了欣赏人们抢夺的模样。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","贝利尔喜欢自由自在地模仿各种东西，但却厌恶各种固定了姿态的有形之物，比如说，神像。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","和尾巴一样，贝利尔的翅膀也是纯粹的装饰，他不需要翅膀也可以飞起来。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","贝利尔偶尔会在敬礼时把脑袋和帽子一起摘下来，以营造一些意外和幽默的效果，但好像大部分人只会受到惊吓。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","“邪魔之影贝利尔，它在月光下现身，浮动，犹如腐臭的地狱——”贝利尔本人认为这种世间的谣传纯属污蔑，因为他在白天也能现身。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","贝利尔并不需要真正的影子才能现身，心灵的阴影同样是影子恶魔喜爱的土壤。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","真是个好日子，对吧？是个非常适合做坏事的天气吧？就在这种非常不合衬的光天化日之下！"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415021.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","贝利尔 & 雷内亚"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","热闹点！再热闹点！"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415148.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","贝利尔"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","猜猜馅饼里头是什么？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415149.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","贝利尔"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","啧，雪啊，没意思"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415467.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","贝利尔"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","我给你们准备了惊喜！"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415468.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","贝利尔"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","啊——这里亮堂了不少，而且真够热闹的！"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415514.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","贝利尔 & 普鲁斯托"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","把这里变得更热闹吧！"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415647.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","贝利尔"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","恶作剧的好时候！"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415648.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","贝利尔"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯！那座小城可是我精心准备了整整半个月的绝佳剧场！"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415767.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","贝利尔 & 拉曼提斯"]]}